@startuml domain-model
title Domain model – place reviews and trip planning (the problem)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ClassBorderColor #666666
hide empty members
hide circle

legend right
  **How to read this diagram**
  |= Notation |= Meaning |
  | Box colour | Aggregate, as on the EventStorming board: the classes that change together |
  | Line with a filled diamond | Composition: the part cannot exist without the whole and is deleted with it |
  | ""/attribute"" | Derived: calculated from other data, not typed in |
  | ""attribute [0..1]"" | Optional: may be unknown |
  | <<value object>> | Has no identity of its own, defined only by its values |
  | <<enumeration>> | Fixed set of allowed values, shared by several classes |
  | <<post-MVP>> | Designed, not in the MVP |
  **Box colours = aggregates**
  |<#F5F5F5> User |
  |<#FFFFFF> Shared enumerations (PriceLevel, PlaceCategory) |
  |<#FFF3C4> Place (with City, Visit) |
  |<#D6ECFA> Review |
  |<#DDF3DD> Saved places |
  |<#CDEFEF> List |
  |<#FFE3CC> Trip (with Day, Itinerary, ItineraryStop) |
  |<#EBDDF7> Published itinerary |
  |<#F3E0A8> Place suggestion |
  |<#F9D9D9> Reminder |
endlegend

class User #F5F5F5 {
  username
  email
  role : USER | ADMIN
}
note bottom of User
  A user with role ADMIN is also the
  moderator of place suggestions.
end note

enum PriceLevel <<enumeration>> #FFFFFF {
  FREE = 0
  € = 1
  €€ = 2
  €€€ = 3
}
note right of PriceLevel
  The numbers are cost points. A place or review
  without a level is unknown and not counted.
  Only a place can be FREE. A review and the trip
  budget level only use € to €€€. The budget level is the target
  average of the whole trip: the mean of the cost
  points of its stops with a known price.
end note

enum PlaceCategory <<enumeration>> #FFFFFF {
  RESTAURANT
  MUSEUM
  MONUMENT
  PARK
  CAFE
  BAR
  OTHER
}

class City #FFF3C4 {
  name
  country
  latitude
  longitude
}

class Place #FFF3C4 {
  name
  description
  category : PlaceCategory
  address
  latitude
  longitude
  openingHours [0..1]
  /priceLevel : PriceLevel [0..1]
  /averageRating
  /reviewCount
}
note right of Place
  /priceLevel: free if OpenStreetMap says no fee,
  otherwise the most common level in its reviews.
  /averageRating and /reviewCount: from its reviews.
end note

class PlaceSuggestion <<post-MVP>> #F3E0A8 {
  proposedName
  proposedCategory : PlaceCategory
  proposedAddress
  status : PENDING | APPROVED | REJECTED
  suggestedAt
  decidedAt [0..1]
}

class Review #D6ECFA {
  rating : 1..5
  priceLevel : € | €€ | €€€ [0..1]
  text
  createdAt
}

class Visit #FFF3C4 {
  visitedAt
}
note right of Visit
  A user has at most one Visit per Place.
  Posting a review creates it.
  Deleting the review does not remove it.
end note

class SavedPlace #DDF3DD {
  type : WISHLIST | BOOKMARK
}
note right of SavedPlace
  WISHLIST: "I want to go there".
  The itinerary generator always includes it.
  BOOKMARK: "remember this for later".
end note

class SavedList #CDEFEF {
  name
}
note right of SavedList
  A list holds bookmarked places only.
  Removing a bookmark removes the place
  from the lists. A place can be in several lists.
end note

class Trip #FFE3CC {
  name
  /averageCostPoints
}
note right of Trip
  /averageCostPoints: mean of the cost points
  of its stops with a known price. The trip is
  over budget when it is above the budget level.
end note

class TripConstraints <<value object>> #FFE3CC {
  startDate
  endDate
  budgetLevel : € | €€ | €€€
  allowedCategories : PlaceCategory [*]
  dayStart : HH:mm
  dayEnd : HH:mm
}
note right of TripConstraints
  dayStart and dayEnd: the hours of the day.
  Default 09:00 to 20:00, from 08:00 to 23:00
  at the widest. Only the generator is limited
  by them; manual planning is free.
end note

class Day #FFE3CC {
  dayNumber
  date
}
note right of Day
  One Day per date between the start
  and the end date of the trip.
end note

class Itinerary #FFE3CC {
  mode : MANUAL | GENERATED
}

class ItineraryStop #FFE3CC {
  visitTime [0..1]
  position
  /outsideOpeningHours
  /travelTimeFromPreviousStop
}
note right of ItineraryStop
  /outsideOpeningHours: the visit time is outside the
  place's opening hours. Only where the hours are known.
  /travelTimeFromPreviousStop: estimate in minutes.
end note

class Reminder <<post-MVP>> #F9D9D9 {
  sentAt
}

class PublishedItinerary <<post-MVP>> #EBDDF7 {
  title
  publishedAt
}
note right of PublishedItinerary
  A copy of an itinerary, so it
  survives deleting the original trip.
end note

class PublishedStop <<post-MVP>> #EBDDF7 {
  dayNumber
  visitTime [0..1]
  position
}

' --- User / Place / Review ---
User "1" -- "*" Review : writes >
Place "1" -- "*" Review : has >
User "1" -- "*" Visit : makes >
Place "1" -- "*" Visit : is visited in >
City "1" -- "*" Place : contains >
PlaceSuggestion "*" -- "1" User : suggested by >
PlaceSuggestion "*" -- "0..1" User : decided by >
PlaceSuggestion "*" -- "1" City : proposed in >
PlaceSuggestion "0..1" -- "0..1" Place : approved as >

' --- Saved places and lists ---
User "1" -- "*" SavedPlace : saves >
SavedPlace "*" -- "1" Place : refers to >
User "1" -- "*" SavedList : owns >
SavedList "*" -- "*" SavedPlace : contains bookmarks >

' --- Trip ---
User "1" -- "*" Trip : plans >
Trip "*" -- "1" City : goes to >
Trip *-- "1" TripConstraints : has >
Trip *-- "*" Day : is divided into >
Trip *-- "0..1" Itinerary : has >
Itinerary *-- "*" ItineraryStop : schedules >
ItineraryStop "*" -- "1" Day : on >
ItineraryStop "*" -- "1" Place : visits >
Reminder "*" -- "1" ItineraryStop : reminds of >

' --- Published itinerary ---
User "1" -- "*" PublishedItinerary : publishes >
PublishedItinerary *-- "*" PublishedStop : has >
PublishedStop "*" -- "1" Place : visits >
User "*" -- "*" PublishedItinerary : bookmarks >
@enduml
